  "_comment": "Source archives that build.ps1 copies to dist\\source (tools/fetch_sources.py), because the GPL and LGPL ask for the source next to the binaries. Each entry is pinned to the exact version that ships and to a SHA-256. 'component' (a native component in tools/sbom_native.py) or 'package' (a Python package) plus 'version' let tools/gen_notices.py fail the build when the bundled version moves on: then update the entry, empty its sha256 and run tools/fetch_sources.py --pin. Hashes taken from an independent source are marked in 'sha256_from'.",
